  EXPERT.tech="A strong technical answer defines the concept precisely, explains the mechanism or formula and the intuition behind it, works through a small numerical example correctly, and says why it matters for a real business or investment decision, including its limitations. It is accurate and concise. Common misses: textbook recitation without intuition, formula or sign errors, no example, confusing related concepts.";
